@startuml CD-02-services
title CD-02 — Lớp backend tại 2bb2011 (24/10/2026)\nMethod rút gọn; dependency có thật, không chứng minh đủ nghiệp vụ đích
hide circle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F2F7F4
skinparam classBorderColor #456657
package Auth {
  class AuthController {
    register(dto)
    login(dto)
    getMe(user)
  }
  class AuthService {
    register(dto)
    login(dto)
    getProfile(userId)
  }
  class UserRepository {
    findByUsername(username)
    findById(id)
    create(data)
  }
  AuthController ..> AuthService
  AuthService ..> UserRepository
}
package Catalog {
  class CatalogController {
    getProducts()
    getProductDetail(id)
  }
  class CatalogService {
    getProducts()
    getProductDetailById(id)
    quoteVariant(tx, id)
    reserveVariant(tx, id, quantity, version)
  }
  class CatalogRepository {
    findAllProducts()
    findDetailById(id)
  }
  CatalogController ..> CatalogService
  CatalogService ..> CatalogRepository
}
package Orders {
  class OrdersController {
    create(user, dto)
    getMyOrders(user, query)
    getOrderDetail(id, user)
  }
  class OrdersService {
    createOrder(userId, dto)
    validateAndPriceItems(items, tx)
    getMyOrdersPage(userId, query)
    getOrderDetail(orderId, userId)
    getOrderForPayment(orderId, userId)
    transitionForPaymentRetry(orderId, userId, reason)
    markOrderPaid(orderId, userId, total, tx)
    markOrderPaymentFailed(orderId, userId, reason, tx)
  }
  class OrdersRepository {
    findOrdersPage(userId, query)
    findOrderDetail(orderId, userId)
    updateStatusWithHistory(...)
    markAsPaid(...)
  }
  class UsersService {
    assertActiveCustomer(tx, id)
  }
  class "InventoryService\nmodules/inventory/inventory.service.ts" as OrderInventory {
    reserve(tx, orderId, expiresAt, needs)
  }
  OrdersController ..> OrdersService
  OrdersService ..> OrdersRepository
  OrdersService ..> UsersService
  OrdersService ..> CatalogService
  OrdersService ..> OrderInventory
  OrderInventory ..> CatalogService
}
package Promotions {
  class PromotionsController
  class PromotionsService {
    validateCoupon(code, subtotal, userId, now)
    quoteAndLock(tx, userId, code, subtotal, now)
    reserve(tx, quote, orderId, expiresAt)
  }
  class PromotionsRepository {
    lockCoupon(...)
    countRedemptions(...)
    createRedemption(...)
    consumeByOrderId(...)
    releaseByOrderId(...)
  }
  PromotionsController ..> PromotionsService
  PromotionsService ..> PromotionsRepository
  OrdersService ..> PromotionsService
}
package Payments {
  class PaymentsController {
    create(dto, idempotencyKey, user)
  }
  class PaymentsService {
    processPayment(params)
  }
  class PaymentsRepository {
    findByIdempotencyKey(key)
    createProcessingPayment(data)
    markSucceeded(...)
    markFailed(...)
  }
  interface IMockGatewayService {
    charge(amount, method)
  }
  class MockGatewayService {
    charge(amount, method)
  }
  PaymentsController ..> PaymentsService
  PaymentsController ..> OrdersService
  PaymentsService ..> PaymentsRepository
  PaymentsService ..> OrdersService
  PaymentsService ..> MockGatewayService
  MockGatewayService ..|> IMockGatewayService
}
package "InventoryModule (provider riêng)" {
  class "InventoryService\nmodules/inventory/services/inventory.service.ts" as ModuleInventory
  class InventoryRepository
  class InventoryExpiryJob
  InventoryExpiryJob ..> ModuleInventory
  ModuleInventory ..> InventoryRepository
}
class PrismaService
UserRepository ..> PrismaService
CatalogRepository ..> PrismaService
OrdersRepository ..> PrismaService
PaymentsRepository ..> PrismaService
PromotionsRepository ..> PrismaService
InventoryRepository ..> PrismaService
OrdersService ..> PrismaService : transaction / create snapshot
PaymentsService ..> PrismaService : payment transaction
note bottom of OrdersService
  Hai InventoryService khác đường dẫn cùng tồn tại:
  Orders inject bản ở inventory/inventory.service.ts.
  InventoryModule export bản trong services/.
  Bản thứ hai không phải dependency trực tiếp của OrdersService.
  Một số service gọi Prisma tx trực tiếp; CSR là kiến trúc đích.
end note
note bottom of PaymentsService
  Có orchestration; không còn stub.
  Hạn giữ, race key, retry FAILED và consume inventory/coupon
  cần đối chiếu UC-08/ADR-004. Chưa có LoyaltyService riêng;
  markAsPaid hiện ghi EARN trong OrdersRepository.
end note
@enduml
